{"findings":[{"rule_id":"NM-002","evidence":[{"kind":"note","ref":"N2","page":1,"quote":"HEAT TREATMENT :-\n1) TO BE TOUGHENED UPTO 24-32 HRC."},{"kind":"title_block","ref":"heat_treatment","page":1,"quote":"---"}],"comment":"Note N2 requires heat treatment (toughened to 24-32 HRC), but the title block heat_treatment field states \"---\", which contradicts the note. This will cause the machinist or inspector to skip a required hardening step, resulting in a part that fails in service. The designer must update the title block heat_treatment field to match the note or remove the note if heat treatment is not required."
  ,
  "recommended_correction":"Change the title block heat_treatment field from \"---\" to specify the required toughening treatment, or delete item 1 of note N2 if no heat treatment is intended."}]}
